    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970402.0483\n\nNEW YORK, April 2 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nURGENT Trading on CompuServe halted on Wall Street\n\n\n\n\nWall Street trading on the computer online service CompuServe was suspended Wednesday ahead of an expected announcement later in the day, a stock exchange spokesman said.",
